#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Process Scheduler
#  File: process_scheduler.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS process scheduler responsible for:
#      • priority-based scheduling
#      • round-robin time slicing
#      • async task execution
#      • process lifecycle management
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Process Registration](ca://s?q=Explain_Process_Registration)
#    - [Priority Scheduling](ca://s?q=Explain_Priority_Scheduling)
#    - [Time Slicing](ca://s?q=Explain_Time_Slicing)
#    - [Scheduler Loop](ca://s?q=Explain_Scheduler_Loop)
#    - [Process Termination](ca://s?q=Explain_Process_Termination)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - register(name, priority, handler)
#         Registers a process with priority.
#
#    - run()
#         Executes scheduler loop.
#
#    - kill(pid)
#         Terminates a process.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns scheduler state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  PROCESS STRUCTURE FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "id": "PRC-XXXX",
#      "name": "network.daemon",
#      "priority": 5,
#      "handler": <async callable>,
#      "state": "ready/running/error",
#      "last_run": <epoch>,
#      "created": <epoch>
#    }
#
